  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Paradise: Decarbonization of the agricultural and forestry sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to Pathways to Prosperity in the region by supporting small producers and service providers with knowledge and skills to apply climate-smart and sustainable practices, contributing to non-deforestation, carbon footprint measurement and carbon sequestration that allow managing the access to differentiated carbon neutral markets for coffee producers. The European Union acts as the overseeing entity for the zero deforestation monitoring methodologies, carbon footprint, carbon credits and multi-stakeholder dialogues that are applied in the project.</narrative>
  </description>
